    Till1 -->|Raw ESC/POS Stream| Port9101
    Till2 -->|Raw ESC/POS Stream| Port9102
    TillN -->|Raw ESC/POS Stream| Port910N

    Port9101 --> ByteParser
    Port9102 --> ByteParser
    Port910N --> ByteParser

    ByteParser -->|Pass-through Stream| AsyncQueue
    ByteParser -->|Binary Graphics Stream| BitmapDecoder
